## Model card

- **Name:** Qwen 3.8
- **Short description:** Alibaba's Qwen 3.8 base family (non-Max, 27B open variant) — distilled from Max for open-weights deployment.
- **Provider / access:** Alibaba Cloud / Hugging Face `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B` — via OpenCode Zen `opencode/qwen-3.8`
- **Release / knowledge:** 2026-08-12 open-weights drop (Max GA 2026-08-03); knowledge cutoff 2026-08
- **IDs:** `qwen/qwen-3.8`, `Qwen/Qwen3.8-27B`
- **Context window:** 256,000 total (256K) — open checkpoint
- **Modalities:** Text in/out only; reasoning yes
- **Pricing (as of 2026-09-23):** Free open-weights (self-host); no verified isolated pricing published
- **Architecture:** MoE 2.4T /95B active (Max), 27B dense for base

